 "text": "Hello! How was your day? Of course. Once upon a time, huh? There was a young boy named Jack who loved to explore the woods near his home. One night, he was out in the woods, when he heard a strange, eerie noise. Jack followed the sound, and soon discovered a tiny, wobbly tree. The tree was waving in the wind, Jack thought. I don't know, Jack thought. Maybe it's just the wind. Jack watched the tree, feeling a bit spooked. But the next night, he heard the same eerie sound again. Jack followed the sound, and found a tiny, wobbly tree.",
